stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Fetch
    Fetch --> Decode: Get instruction from memory
    Decode --> Execute: Interpret the instruction
    Execute --> Fetch: Store result, repeat
    
    state Fetch {
        [*] --> ReadPC: Copy PC to Memory Address Register
        ReadPC --> GetMem: Read memory at that address
        GetMem --> IncPC: Increment Program Counter
        IncPC --> StoreIR: Store instruction in Instruction Register
        StoreIR --> [*]
    }
    
    state Decode {
        [*] --> ParseOp: Identify operation (ADD, SUB, LOAD)
        ParseOp --> GetOperands: Identify data locations
        GetOperands --> [*]
    }
    
    state Execute {
        [*] --> Perform: ALU performs the operation
        Perform --> WriteBack: Store result in register/memory
        WriteBack --> [*]
    }
    
    note right of Fetch
        The CPU spends most of its time
        in this loop, billions of times
        per second!
    end note
